1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Hello again. You.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Are you ever going to tell me why you abandoned your own family?

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Oh, come on, say it!

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
If you don't, you're gonna keep having this dream.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
It's a reflection of the darkness inside of you.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
I now dwell within you.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
And I am.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
I am the power.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Call for me when you feel like your spirit's breaking.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
You must surrender yourself to me.

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Then I can get you the revenge that you so desire.

12
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Oh, and there's one last thing. Wake up you.

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Finally.

14
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,000
It's about time I got the chance to kill some vampires.

15
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Mika.

16
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:41,000
I don't want nobody to get killed.

17
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,000
I come and get you, I'm always ready to fight.

18
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:55,000
So don't take all of the blame where all is wet.

19
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Always don't take all of the weight you always do.

20
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:02,000
There will always be something you cannot control.

21
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:07,000
We will overcome your salvation has begun.

22
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:13,000
No suns, no lights, such a mess all over.

23
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Don't kill your wolves.

24
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:21,000
You make me realize who I need.

25
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:25,000
I'll be there, hold on, the changes somehow.

26
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,000
So where are you now?

27
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,000
I'll reach you.

28
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Find out the shadows of the earth.

29
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,000
You lose your support.

30
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,000
The golden end is still wrong.

31
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:45,000
But I know it is a pain that makes us so human after all.

32
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
Toin and save you for the control.

33
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,000
About your precious worth.

34
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
This heart may respond to your call.

35
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:15,000
My, my, take a look at you.

36
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,000
That uniform looks awfully good on you.

37
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,000
Oh, thanks.

38
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,000
And you...

39
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Oh, never mind.

40
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:28,000
You don't have to say it, I know what you're thinking.

41
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,000
You look dropped at gorgeous, Shinoa.

42
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,000
So, I thought we were meeting there.

43
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,000
Don't you want your orders?

44
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Let's hear them.

45
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Do you remember the vampires Gurren mentioned?

46
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,000
He wants us to go to Shinjuku to investigate.

47
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Let me ask you this.

48
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,000
Are we gonna kill bloodsuckers when we get there?

49
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,000
We get it.

50
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,000
You hate vampires.

51
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,000
Enough with the blood lust.

52
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,000
Is that all you're interested in?

53
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:12,000
There's more to our job than just killing vampires.

54
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Hey, are you listening?

55
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
But you're so boring.

56
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:20,000
I guess you don't want to survive once we get outside the wall.

57
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,000
Hmph.

58
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:54,000
We're from the Moon Demon Company.

59
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,000
We have orders beyond the wall.

60
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,000
Would you please let us out?

61
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,000
What?

62
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,000
There's no way.

63
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,000
That's an elite squad, right?

64
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,000
Yeah, it's no place for little kids.

65
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Shut up.

66
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,000
They can hear you.

67
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,000
Hey, he just called you a kid.

68
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,000
How'd you like that?

69
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:08,000
They're talking about you.

70
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,000
Cause you're so short.

71
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,000
Whatever.

72
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,000
I won't be short forever.

73
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,000
I'm still blossoming.

74
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
My sister Mahiru was taller.

75
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:18,000
And she had the kind of rag that made all the boys lust after her.

76
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,000
Huh.

77
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,000
I didn't know you have a sister.

78
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,000
No, I had a sister.

79
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,000
Shino.

80
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,000
I'm sorry.

81
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,000
What?

82
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:35,000
You don't have a silly comeback for that one?

83
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Okay.

84
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,000
Let's get going, you.

85
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:47,000
In a completely devastated world like this, it seems everybody's lost someone who's important to them.

86
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:50,000
It's just a way of life.

87
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,000
Lieutenant Colonel Gurren!

88
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,000
What in the hell is going on?

89
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:01,000
You wanna explain why I've been placed in a squad full of new recruits?

90
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,000
Who's that girl?

91
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,000
Who is she?

92
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,000
I've been in the extermination unit since I was 13 years old!

93
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,000
Maybe she's a new member like you.

94
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,000
I was 13 years old!

95
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,000
Let's find out.

96
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,000
Hey, wait up!

97
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,000
There you are!

98
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Hey, you!

99
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,000
Would it kill you to be on time?

100
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,000
If I have to look at your ugly mug.

101
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,000
What's going on over there?

102
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:25,000
I could understand if you had made me team leader in charge of the noobs, but you chose her!

103
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,000
You've gotta be kidding me!

104
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:30,000
Do you seriously think Shinoah Haragi is more qualified than I am?

105
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Well, well.

106
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,000
Look who's here.

107
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,000
You!

108
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,000
How dare you, Shinoah!

109
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,000
You're no team leader!

110
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,000
Sorry, Mitsu.

111
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:38,000
But Gurren thinks I'm right for the job.

112
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:44,000
Don't even think about it, Mitsuba.

113
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,000
From this day forward, Shinoah is your team leader, so I...

114
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Don't worry, Lieutenant Colonel.

115
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:50,000
I can handle Mitsuba's temper.

116
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,000
After all, I'm a mature woman.

117
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,000
The whining of an incompetent loser doesn't affect me one bit.

118
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,000
I'll destroy you!

119
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:21,000
I hope that you ladies like solitary confinement.

120
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,000
Cause that's where you're headed if you keep this up.

121
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,000
I'll behave.

122
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,000
Yeah, I will do.

123
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:34,000
I'm gonna take a different route to Shinjuku, but I'll meet you there.

124
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:37,000
Before I go, let me make one thing clear.

125
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:41,000
The Moon Demon Company squads move in a five-man formation.

126
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:43,000
That's why Mitsuba's here.

127
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,000
We've found that five is the golden number when facing armed vampires.

128
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:50,000
Any more than that and attacks can get confusing.

129
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,000
Any less and we start losing troops.

130
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,000
So I want the five of you to stick together.

131
00:07:55,000 --> 00:08:00,000
I don't want any more infighting while one of you idiots trying to fly solo.

132
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:02,000
Is that clear?

133
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,000
As crystal, sir.

134
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,000
Hear that?

135
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,000
Mr. Reckless behavior?

136
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,000
Hmph.

137
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,000
I can't promise anything.

138
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:12,000
If I come face to face with a vamp, I may just have to...

139
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:17,000
What's your problem?

140
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,000
Oh, wow.

141
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,000
Quick reflexes, kid.

142
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:23,000
Now I get it, Lieutenant Colonel Gurren.

143
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:28,000
You put me on this squad so I could train the new recruits.

144
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Consider it dead, sir.

145
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,000
What are they gonna learn from a troublemaker?

146
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:35,000
Since when have I ever caused you any trouble?

147
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,000
Oh, man.

148
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,000
That girl is a pain in the ass.

149
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,000
For real.

150
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,000
Oh, wow.

151
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:43,000
If you're calling someone a pain in the ass, they must be pretty bad.

152
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,000
You say something?

153
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Nope.

154
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,000
Not me.

155
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,000
Nuh-uh.

156
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,000
Did her kick hurt?

157
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,000
Kinda.

158
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,000
I'm okay.

159
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,000
Listen up.

160
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:59,000
Your fellow squad members are now your comrades, got it?

161
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,000
That means they're more important than family.

162
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,000
Protect them with your life.

163
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Okay.

164
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Are you ready for your first mission?

165
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:12,000
I want the five of you to head to Harajuku.

166
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:15,000
According to our intel, there's a growing vampire settlement there.

167
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:18,000
Crush them and free the people there holding hostage.

168
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Then head north to Shinjuku.

169
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:23,000
This place is a wreck.

170
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,000
I barely remember what it used to look like anymore.

171
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:30,000
I haven't been outside the wall since I've been in the demon army's custody.

172
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:36,000
Before you and Kamizuki joined our General Ed class, you used to patrol the outside as guards, didn't you?

173
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,000
That's right.

174
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,000
It sucked.

175
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:47,000
You think you're tough just because you killed a couple of four horsemen of Jonth right outside the spell-protected wall?

176
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:50,000
Anybody could do that, loser.

177
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:55,000
The ones near the wall are weak, but once you get a half mile out or more, they're ruthless.

178
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:58,000
They're much stronger than anything you've ever fought back at headquarters.

179
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,000
You better be ready for the fight of your lives.

180
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,000
If you're not, then leave now.

181
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:05,000
We can't afford to have any weaklings in our squad, you hear me?

182
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,000
One little slip and we're all dead, so stay alert.

183
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,000
No chit-chatting and don't break formation.

184
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,000
Amateurs.

185
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,000
Is she always like this?

186
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,000
Could she be any more adorable?

187
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:21,000
Seems she's feeling the pressure of responsibility.

188
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,000
She doesn't want you dying on her watch.

189
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,000
It's a Rajaku station.

190
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:48,000
Well, this is the spot.

191
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:52,000
Yeah. Now how are we supposed to find the vampires?

192
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:02,000
A four horsemen of Jon!

193
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,000
Damn it!

194
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,000
What do you think you're doing?

195
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Helping!

196
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,000
Don't break formation.

197
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,000
Someone help!

198
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:18,000
We gotta go and save her!

199
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,000
Come on!

200
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,000
That monster's gonna kill her!

201
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,000
Shut up!

202
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:26,000
What good's the vampire extermination unit if we can't even save one kid?

203
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,000
Shut up!

204
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,000
Let go of me!

205
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,000
Can't you see this is one of their traps?

206
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:38,000
As soon as we go out to save her, they'll attack and we'll all be dead.

207
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:52,000
I'm willing to put my life on the line.

208
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,000
Let me save her!

209
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,000
Forget it! We're gonna stand by!

210
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,000
Are you really gonna let that little girl die?

211
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:01,000
If you wanna stand by then so be it.

212
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,000
But I'm not abandoning anyone ever again!

213
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,000
Wait!

214
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,000
Oh no!

215
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Don't move, Kamizuki!

216
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:10,000
The vampires are coming. We have to be on alert!

217
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:19,700
Wait!

218
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:22,900
Oh, no!

219
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:26,700
Don't move, Kameizuki.

220
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:29,200
The vampires are coming.

221
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:30,740
We have to be on alert.

222
00:12:40,000 --> 00:13:03,160
The vampires are using her as bait to lure us out.

223
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:06,520
Are you sure?

224
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:08,040
Because that doesn't make sense.

225
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:10,640
The Four Horsemen of John have no will of their own.

226
00:13:11,180 --> 00:13:12,760
So why would they obey the vampires?

227
00:13:13,620 --> 00:13:14,940
They're not obeying.

228
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:16,300
They only kill humans.

229
00:13:16,780 --> 00:13:18,860
They're simply following their natural instincts.

230
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:22,940
It's as if they were created to keep humanity's population under control.

231
00:13:23,340 --> 00:13:24,000
Go, now!

232
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:31,600
You're dead!

233
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,660
Here come the vamps!

234
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:40,120
See?

235
00:13:40,380 --> 00:13:40,920
I told you.

236
00:13:41,260 --> 00:13:42,740
They release bait for the monsters.

237
00:13:43,180 --> 00:13:45,080
And then attack the humans who try to help.

238
00:13:46,100 --> 00:13:47,280
That was too easy.

239
00:13:47,620 --> 00:13:49,460
It's the oldest vampire trick in the book.

240
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:50,320
Heads up, kid!

241
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:50,820
Don't look away at you!

242
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:06,720
Bless me your power.

243
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:09,720
Watch for the murder!

244
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:16,900
So strong. Who's here?

245
00:14:21,540 --> 00:14:22,580
Yakuya!

246
00:14:33,580 --> 00:14:36,540
You left yourself wide open, dumbass.

247
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:46,500
Oh, wow. Thanks, guys. You saved me.

248
00:15:00,180 --> 00:15:01,960
How do they have cursed gear?

249
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:04,540
They're the vampire extermination unit.

250
00:15:04,820 --> 00:15:07,000
Call for backup. I'll bet we can capture them.

251
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:09,520
No way.

252
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:20,580
All right, that's enough. Now, I think we should retreat.

253
00:15:21,380 --> 00:15:24,840
Go right ahead. Run from the butcher, livestock.

254
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,320
What the hell did you call us?

255
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:33,940
Let's fall back. Ain't gonna happen.

256
00:15:33,940 --> 00:15:39,040
Let them go, you. We're behind enemy lines. We need to leave before their backup gets here.

257
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:45,140
Okay, fine.

258
00:15:45,140 --> 00:16:03,640
How could you be so stupid? Your reckless behavior put our entire squad in danger.

259
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:08,000
You're lucky those vampires only had second-class weapons. Otherwise, we'd be...

260
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:13,660
Look, I'm sorry. I should have followed orders.

261
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:18,860
But I don't regret what I did. That girl would have been dead if it wasn't for me.

262
00:16:18,860 --> 00:16:22,780
Go ahead. Punch me as much as you want.

263
00:16:22,780 --> 00:16:24,560
If it'll make you feel better.

264
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:27,380
But I would do it all over again.

265
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:32,240
You're an idiot. I hate people like you more than anything.

266
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:34,740
You're impulsive and stubborn.

267
00:16:34,740 --> 00:16:37,840
You would put your whole squad in danger.

268
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:40,380
Excuse me?

269
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:44,860
Thanks for saving me.

270
